# Input

```css
#app, #Brand, #ABCG { color: #ABC; }
.colors {
  three: #ABC;
  four: #ABCD;
  six: #ABCDEF;
  eight: #ABCDEF12;
  quoted: "#app" "#ABCG";
  --raw: #ABC;
  fragment: url(#app);
}

```


# Formatted

